        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make pancakes on  Steam! Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook pancakes without burning them, then add fruits and sauces on top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Score Attack]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/b6dcfe1954ffb018d89ad61c1a2fb269.poster.avif?t=1776302200\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/b6dcfe1954ffb018d89ad61c1a2fb269.webm?t=1776302200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/b6dcfe1954ffb018d89ad61c1a2fb269.mp4?t=1776302200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook up as many pancakes as possible and aim for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Battle]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/a7b59b63f249597e6fd0738b89972e73.poster.avif?t=1776302200\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/a7b59b63f249597e6fd0738b89972e73.webm?t=1776302200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/a7b59b63f249597e6fd0738b89972e73.mp4?t=1776302200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your pancake-making skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>《Rules》</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pancakes to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack them up high, then add scrumptious toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep cooking until time runs out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>《How to Play》</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Spread the batter on the pan and start cooking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Once one side is cooked, flip it over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Flip fully cooked pancakes onto a plate and start adding toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Add fruit on top! Choose from strawberries, nuts, bananas, blueberries, kiwi, and mango!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Drizzle on a sauce! Choose from chocolate sauce, cream, and honey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Once the pancakes are done, it's time to serve! The closer they match the order, the more points you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To receive news and update notifications</strong><br>Please click on <strong>Developer: SAT-BOX</strong> at the top of the store page and <strong>Follow</strong> us!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make pancakes on  Steam! Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook pancakes without burning them, then add fruits and sauces on top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Score Attack]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/b6dcfe1954ffb018d89ad61c1a2fb269.poster.avif?t=1776302200\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/b6dcfe1954ffb018d89ad61c1a2fb269.webm?t=1776302200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/b6dcfe1954ffb018d89ad61c1a2fb269.mp4?t=1776302200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook up as many pancakes as possible and aim for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Battle]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/a7b59b63f249597e6fd0738b89972e73.poster.avif?t=1776302200\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/a7b59b63f249597e6fd0738b89972e73.webm?t=1776302200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928650/extras/a7b59b63f249597e6fd0738b89972e73.mp4?t=1776302200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your pancake-making skills!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>《Rules》</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pancakes to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack them up high, then add scrumptious toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep cooking until time runs out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>《How to Play》</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Spread the batter on the pan and start cooking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Once one side is cooked, flip it over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Flip fully cooked pancakes onto a plate and start adding toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Add fruit on top! Choose from strawberries, nuts, bananas, blueberries, kiwi, and mango!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Drizzle on a sauce! Choose from chocolate sauce, cream, and honey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Once the pancakes are done, it's time to serve! The closer they match the order, the more points you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To receive news and update notifications</strong><br>Please click on <strong>Developer: SAT-BOX</strong> at the top of the store page and <strong>Follow</strong> us!</p>",
